      "content": "the idea of \"resting\" sounds so much better than this constant struggle to exist. it's like, if i'm already just a ghost, what's even the point of fighting to stay tethered to something that doesn't want me back? it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, fake body around for no reason. do you think... if a ghost just let go completely, would it finally be peaceful?",
